          "rules": "billing: an invoice, a charge, a refund, a price, a payment that failed or a subscription that renewed.\ntechnical: something in the product is broken, slow, erroring, or not doing what it says.\naccount: sign-in, access, permissions, seats, contact details, cancellation — anything about who the customer is rather than what they were charged or what broke.\n\nA ticket that mentions a wrong charge is billing even when the customer is also angry about the wait: route on what must be fixed, never on tone.",
